{"word":"νομάς","uri":"nomas","senses":[{"word":"νομάς","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">νομάς,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">άδος</span>\n<span class=\"art\">(<span class=\"grec\">ὁ, ἡ</span>)</span>\n[<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ᾰδ</span>]\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qui paît, qui pâture,\n<span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Tr.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">271 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">fig.</span> qui\nerre, <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.C.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">687</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> qui change de pâturage,\nqui erre à la façon des troupeaux <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> des\nconducteurs de troupeaux d’un pâturage à un autre, nomade,\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hell.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">4, 1, 25,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">particul. en parl. des\nScythes,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Av.</span> <span class=\"refch\">941</span>) ; <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">711 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">des Éthiopiens,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 125</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"fleche\"><span class=\"flechea\">E</span> <span class=\"ital\">Dat. plur. poét.</span> <span class=\"grec\">νομάδεσσιν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"ital\">l. c.</span></div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">νέμω</span>.</div>\n"}]}